    "description": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\">\n <p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p>\n <p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Regimens\" title=\"Force Regimens\">Force Regimens</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vo%27ren_Faalo\" title=\"Vo'ren Faalo\">Vo'ren Faalo</a></i> </p>\n <p><i>Vo'ren's Second Cadence</i>&nbsp;teaches not only control, but also spacial awareness. You must set up 72 wax cylinders at 5-degree intervals around your body, each one approximately 1.5 meters away. Atop each cylinder, one metal ball bearing is placed. Like <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vo%27ren%27s_First_Cadence\" title=\"Vo'ren's First Cadence\">Vo'ren's First Cadence</a></i>, you must place the cylinders and ball bearings one at a time until all 72 have been placed. However, unlike the first cadence, you must strike at all of the cylinders in a full 360-degree arc without turning your body to face the cylinders to the rear, honing your ability to strike at enemies coming from all sides. </p>\n <p><b>Time:</b> 2 Hours </p>\n <p><b>Targets:</b> Self </p>\n <p><b>Requirements:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, 72 wax cylinders, and 2,701 ball bearings. </p>\n <p><b>Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check.</b> You take a penalty on your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>. The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen: </p> \n <table class=\"wikitable\"> \n  <tbody>\n   <tr> \n    <th>DC </th> \n    <th> </th> \n    <th>EFFECT </th>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>18-22 </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You damage two cylinders. You gain a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> attack rolls against creatures that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flank\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flank\">Flank</a> you. </td>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>23-27 </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You damage one cylinder. You gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> attack rolls against creatures that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flank\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flank\">Flank</a> you. </td>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>28+ </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You complete the cadence without damaging any cylinders. You gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a> attack rolls against creatures that <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flank\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flank\">Flank</a> you, and you gain the benefits of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Whirlwind_Attack\" title=\"Whirlwind Attack\">Whirlwind Attack</a> Feat (If you do not already know it). </td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table> <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20220315185529\nCache expiry: 1209600\nDynamic content: false\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument s